    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../stylesheet/help.css">
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <h1>Help & Support</h1>
        <p style="text-align: center;">Aapki madad ke liye hum yahan hain. Kuch common sawaal niche diye gaye hain:</p>
        
        <div class="faq-box">
            <h2>Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)</h2>
            
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>1. Account kaise create karein?</h3>
                <p>Sign Up page par jakar apni details fill karein aur aapka account turant taiyar ho jayega.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>2. Kya ye service free hai?</h3>
                <p>Haan, basic features sabhi ke liye bilkul free hain. Premium features ke liye hamare plans jald hi aa rahe hain.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="faq-item">
                <h3>3. Support team se kaise baat karein?</h3>
                <p>Aap hamare <a href="/contact" style="color: #3498db; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold;">Contact Page</a> par jakar form fill kar sakte hain, hum 24 ghante mein reply karenge.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div style="text-align: center; margin-top: 40px;">
            <p>Sawaal ka jawab nahi mila? Direct contact karein: <strong>support@example.com</strong></p>
        </div>
    </div>

